<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">Reflects the <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">write-off</FONT> of prepaid expense related to Predecessor
directors&#8217; and officers&#8217; insurance policy. The policy related to coverage for the Predecessor directors&#8217; and officers&#8217; and has no future economic benefit to the Successor entity following emergence. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
