reorganization for the three months ended September&nbsp;28, 2025. The Company also incurred restructuring charges during the three months ended September&nbsp;28, 2025 and for the year ended June&nbsp;29, 2025, in connection with the 2025
Restructuring Plan consisting of a headcount reduction and facility closure and consolidation plan intended to optimize its cost structure. In addition, <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">pre-petition</FONT> bankruptcy-related charges of
